{"route":"/docs/5.3/utilities/colors/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Colors","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Convey meaning through <code>color</code> with a handful of color utility classes. Includes support for styling links with hover states, too."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"content--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Accessibility tip:</strong> Using color to add meaning only provides a visual indication, which will not be conveyed to users of assistive technologies like screen readers. Please ensure the meaning is obvious from the content itself (e.g., the visible text with a <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility/#color-contrast\"><em>sufficient</em> color contrast</a>) or is included through alternative means, such as additional text hidden with the <code>.visually-hidden</code> class."}]},{"id":"colors","type":"heading","en":"Colors","level":2},{"id":"colors--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Colorize text with color utilities. If you want to colorize links, you can use the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/helpers/colored-links\"><code>.link-*</code> helper classes</a> which have <code>:hover</code> and <code>:focus</code> states."},{"id":"colors--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"colors--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Color utilities like <code>.text-*</code> that generated from our original <code>$theme-colors</code> Sass map don’t yet respond to color modes, however, any <code>.text-*-emphasis</code> utility will. This will be resolved in v6."}]},{"id":"colors--example-1","type":"demo","key":"45bbf0fea647fe1e4b4f","height":300},{"id":"colors--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p class=\"text-primary\">.text-primary</p>\n<p class=\"text-primary-emphasis\">.text-primary-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-secondary\">.text-secondary</p>\n<p class=\"text-secondary-emphasis\">.text-secondary-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-success\">.text-success</p>\n<p class=\"text-success-emphasis\">.text-success-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-danger\">.text-danger</p>\n<p class=\"text-danger-emphasis\">.text-danger-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-warning bg-dark\">.text-warning</p>\n<p class=\"text-warning-emphasis\">.text-warning-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-info bg-dark\">.text-info</p>\n<p class=\"text-info-emphasis\">.text-info-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-light bg-dark\">.text-light</p>\n<p class=\"text-light-emphasis\">.text-light-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-dark bg-white\">.text-dark</p>\n<p class=\"text-dark-emphasis\">.text-dark-emphasis</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-body\">.text-body</p>\n<p class=\"text-body-emphasis\">.text-body-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-body-secondary\">.text-body-secondary</p>\n<p class=\"text-body-tertiary\">.text-body-tertiary</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-black bg-white\">.text-black</p>\n<p class=\"text-white bg-dark\">.text-white</p>\n<p class=\"text-black-50 bg-white\">.text-black-50</p>\n<p class=\"text-white-50 bg-dark\">.text-white-50</p>","language":"html"},{"id":"colors--note-2","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"colors--note-text-2","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Deprecation:</strong> With the addition of <code>.text-opacity-*</code> utilities and CSS variables for text utilities, <code>.text-black-50</code> and <code>.text-white-50</code> are deprecated as of v5.1.0. They’ll be removed in v6.0.0."}]},{"id":"colors--note-3","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"colors--note-text-3","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Deprecation:</strong> With the addition of the expanded theme colors and variables, the <code>.text-muted</code> utility has been deprecated as of v5.3.0. Its default value has also been reassigned to the new <code>--bs-secondary-color</code> CSS variable to better support color modes. It will be removed in v6.0.0."}]},{"id":"opacity","type":"heading","en":"Opacity","level":2},{"id":"opacity--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<small>Added in v5.1.0</small>"},{"id":"opacity--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"As of v5.1.0, text color utilities are generated with Sass using CSS variables. This allows for real-time color changes without compilation and dynamic alpha transparency changes."},{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":3},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Consider our default <code>.text-primary</code> utility."},{"id":"how-it-works--code-1","type":"code","value":".text-primary {\n  --bs-text-opacity: 1;\n  color: rgba(var(--bs-primary-rgb), var(--bs-text-opacity)) !important;\n}","language":"css"},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"We use an RGB version of our <code>--bs-primary</code> (with the value of <code>13, 110, 253</code>) CSS variable and attached a second CSS variable, <code>--bs-text-opacity</code>, for the alpha transparency (with a default value <code>1</code> thanks to a local CSS variable). That means anytime you use <code>.text-primary</code> now, your computed <code>color</code> value is <code>rgba(13, 110, 253, 1)</code>. The local CSS variable inside each <code>.text-*</code> class avoids inheritance issues so nested instances of the utilities don’t automatically have a modified alpha transparency."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":3},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"To change that opacity, override <code>--bs-text-opacity</code> via custom styles or inline styles."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"157831d0a6a891147dc4","height":174},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"text-primary\">This is default primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary\" style=\"--bs-text-opacity: .5;\">This is 50% opacity primary text</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"example--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Or, choose from any of the <code>.text-opacity</code> utilities:"},{"id":"example--example-2","type":"demo","key":"a2a4f3157a517f8db6b8","height":228},{"id":"example--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"text-primary\">This is default primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary text-opacity-75\">This is 75% opacity primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary text-opacity-50\">This is 50% opacity primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary text-opacity-25\">This is 25% opacity primary text</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"specificity","type":"heading","en":"Specificity","level":2},{"id":"specificity--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Sometimes contextual classes cannot be applied due to the specificity of another selector. In some cases, a sufficient workaround is to wrap your element’s content in a <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> or more semantic element with the desired class."},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"css--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to the following Sass functionality, consider reading about our included <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/css-variables\">CSS custom properties</a> (aka CSS variables) for colors and more."},{"id":"sass-variables","type":"heading","en":"Sass variables","level":3},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Most <code>color</code> utilities are generated by our theme colors, reassigned from our generic color palette variables."},{"id":"sass-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$blue:    #0d6efd;\n$indigo:  #6610f2;\n$purple:  #6f42c1;\n$pink:    #d63384;\n$red:     #dc3545;\n$orange:  #fd7e14;\n$yellow:  #ffc107;\n$green:   #198754;\n$teal:    #20c997;\n$cyan:    #0dcaf0;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--code-2","type":"code","value":"$primary:       $blue;\n$secondary:     $gray-600;\n$success:       $green;\n$info:          $cyan;\n$warning:       $yellow;\n$danger:        $red;\n$light:         $gray-100;\n$dark:          $gray-900;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Grayscale colors are also available, but only a subset are used to generate any utilities."},{"id":"sass-variables--code-3","type":"code","value":"$white:    #fff;\n$gray-100: #f8f9fa;\n$gray-200: #e9ecef;\n$gray-300: #dee2e6;\n$gray-400: #ced4da;\n$gray-500: #adb5bd;\n$gray-600: #6c757d;\n$gray-700: #495057;\n$gray-800: #343a40;\n$gray-900: #212529;\n$black:    #000;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--code-4","type":"code","value":"$theme-colors-text: (\n  \"primary\": $primary-text-emphasis,\n  \"secondary\": $secondary-text-emphasis,\n  \"success\": $success-text-emphasis,\n  \"info\": $info-text-emphasis,\n  \"warning\": $warning-text-emphasis,\n  \"danger\": $danger-text-emphasis,\n  \"light\": $light-text-emphasis,\n  \"dark\": $dark-text-emphasis,\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Variables for setting colors in <code>.text-*-emphasis</code> utilities in light and dark mode:"},{"id":"sass-variables--code-5","type":"code","value":"$primary-text-emphasis:   shade-color($primary, 60%);\n$secondary-text-emphasis: shade-color($secondary, 60%);\n$success-text-emphasis:   shade-color($success, 60%);\n$info-text-emphasis:      shade-color($info, 60%);\n$warning-text-emphasis:   shade-color($warning, 60%);\n$danger-text-emphasis:    shade-color($danger, 60%);\n$light-text-emphasis:     $gray-700;\n$dark-text-emphasis:      $gray-700;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--code-6","type":"code","value":"$primary-text-emphasis-dark:        tint-color($primary, 40%);\n$secondary-text-emphasis-dark:      tint-color($secondary, 40%);\n$success-text-emphasis-dark:        tint-color($success, 40%);\n$info-text-emphasis-dark:           tint-color($info, 40%);\n$warning-text-emphasis-dark:        tint-color($warning, 40%);\n$danger-text-emphasis-dark:         tint-color($danger, 40%);\n$light-text-emphasis-dark:          $gray-100;\n$dark-text-emphasis-dark:           $gray-300;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-maps","type":"heading","en":"Sass maps","level":3},{"id":"sass-maps--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Theme colors are then put into a Sass map so we can loop over them to generate our utilities, component modifiers, and more."},{"id":"sass-maps--code-1","type":"code","value":"$theme-colors: (\n  \"primary\":    $primary,\n  \"secondary\":  $secondary,\n  \"success\":    $success,\n  \"info\":       $info,\n  \"warning\":    $warning,\n  \"danger\":     $danger,\n  \"light\":      $light,\n  \"dark\":       $dark\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-maps--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Grayscale colors are also available as a Sass map. <strong>This map is not used to generate any utilities.</strong>"},{"id":"sass-maps--code-2","type":"code","value":"$grays: (\n  \"100\": $gray-100,\n  \"200\": $gray-200,\n  \"300\": $gray-300,\n  \"400\": $gray-400,\n  \"500\": $gray-500,\n  \"600\": $gray-600,\n  \"700\": $gray-700,\n  \"800\": $gray-800,\n  \"900\": $gray-900\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-maps--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"RGB colors are generated from a separate Sass map:"},{"id":"sass-maps--code-3","type":"code","value":"$theme-colors-rgb: map-loop($theme-colors, to-rgb, \"$value\");","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-maps--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Color opacities build on that with their own map that’s consumed by the utilities API:"},{"id":"sass-maps--code-4","type":"code","value":"$utilities-text: map-merge(\n  $utilities-colors,\n  (\n    \"black\": to-rgb($black),\n    \"white\": to-rgb($white),\n    \"body\": to-rgb($body-color)\n  )\n);\n$utilities-text-colors: map-loop($utilities-text, rgba-css-var, \"$key\", \"text\");\n\n$utilities-text-emphasis-colors: (\n  \"primary-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}primary-text-emphasis),\n  \"secondary-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}secondary-text-emphasis),\n  \"success-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}success-text-emphasis),\n  \"info-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}info-text-emphasis),\n  \"warning-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}warning-text-emphasis),\n  \"danger-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}danger-text-emphasis),\n  \"light-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}light-text-emphasis),\n  \"dark-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}dark-text-emphasis)\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-maps--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Color mode adaptive text colors are also available as a Sass map:"},{"id":"sass-maps--code-5","type":"code","value":"$theme-colors-text: (\n  \"primary\": $primary-text-emphasis,\n  \"secondary\": $secondary-text-emphasis,\n  \"success\": $success-text-emphasis,\n  \"info\": $info-text-emphasis,\n  \"warning\": $warning-text-emphasis,\n  \"danger\": $danger-text-emphasis,\n  \"light\": $light-text-emphasis,\n  \"dark\": $dark-text-emphasis,\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-maps--code-6","type":"code","value":"$theme-colors-text-dark: (\n  \"primary\": $primary-text-emphasis-dark,\n  \"secondary\": $secondary-text-emphasis-dark,\n  \"success\": $success-text-emphasis-dark,\n  \"info\": $info-text-emphasis-dark,\n  \"warning\": $warning-text-emphasis-dark,\n  \"danger\": $danger-text-emphasis-dark,\n  \"light\": $light-text-emphasis-dark,\n  \"dark\": $dark-text-emphasis-dark,\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Color utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"color\": (\n  property: color,\n  class: text,\n  local-vars: (\n    \"text-opacity\": 1\n  ),\n  values: map-merge(\n    $utilities-text-colors,\n    (\n      \"muted\": var(--#{$prefix}secondary-color), // deprecated\n      \"black-50\": rgba($black, .5), // deprecated\n      \"white-50\": rgba($white, .5), // deprecated\n      \"body-secondary\": var(--#{$prefix}secondary-color),\n      \"body-tertiary\": var(--#{$prefix}tertiary-color),\n      \"body-emphasis\": var(--#{$prefix}emphasis-color),\n      \"reset\": inherit,\n    )\n  )\n),\n\"text-opacity\": (\n  css-var: true,\n  class: text-opacity,\n  values: (\n    25: .25,\n    50: .5,\n    75: .75,\n    100: 1\n  )\n),\n\"text-color\": (\n  property: color,\n  class: text,\n  values: $utilities-text-emphasis-colors\n),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"45bbf0fea647fe1e4b4f","html":" <p class=\"text-primary\">.text-primary</p>\n<p class=\"text-primary-emphasis\">.text-primary-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-secondary\">.text-secondary</p>\n<p class=\"text-secondary-emphasis\">.text-secondary-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-success\">.text-success</p>\n<p class=\"text-success-emphasis\">.text-success-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-danger\">.text-danger</p>\n<p class=\"text-danger-emphasis\">.text-danger-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-warning bg-dark\">.text-warning</p>\n<p class=\"text-warning-emphasis\">.text-warning-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-info bg-dark\">.text-info</p>\n<p class=\"text-info-emphasis\">.text-info-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-light bg-dark\">.text-light</p>\n<p class=\"text-light-emphasis\">.text-light-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-dark bg-white\">.text-dark</p>\n<p class=\"text-dark-emphasis\">.text-dark-emphasis</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-body\">.text-body</p>\n<p class=\"text-body-emphasis\">.text-body-emphasis</p>\n<p class=\"text-body-secondary\">.text-body-secondary</p>\n<p class=\"text-body-tertiary\">.text-body-tertiary</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-black bg-white\">.text-black</p>\n<p class=\"text-white bg-dark\">.text-white</p>\n<p class=\"text-black-50 bg-white\">.text-black-50</p>\n<p class=\"text-white-50 bg-dark\">.text-white-50</p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"157831d0a6a891147dc4","html":" <div class=\"text-primary\">This is default primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary\" style=\"--bs-text-opacity: .5;\">This is 50% opacity primary text</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a2a4f3157a517f8db6b8","html":" <div class=\"text-primary\">This is default primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary text-opacity-75\">This is 75% opacity primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary text-opacity-50\">This is 50% opacity primary text</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary text-opacity-25\">This is 25% opacity primary text</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/vite"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rfs"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rtl"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contribute"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/overview"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/sass"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/options"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color"},{"en":"Color modes","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color-modes"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/components"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/css-variables"},{"en":"Optimize","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/optimize"},{"en":"Breakpoints","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/breakpoints"},{"en":"Containers","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/containers"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/grid"},{"en":"Columns","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/columns"},{"en":"Gutters","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/gutters"},{"en":"Utilities","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/utilities"},{"en":"Z-index","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/z-index"},{"en":"CSS Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/css-grid"},{"en":"Reboot","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/content/reboot"},{"en":"Typography","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/content/typography"},{"en":"Images","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/content/images"},{"en":"Tables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/content/tables"},{"en":"Figures","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/content/figures"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/overview"},{"en":"Form control","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/form-control"},{"en":"Select","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/select"},{"en":"Checks & radios","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/checks-radios"},{"en":"Range","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/range"},{"en":"Input group","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/input-group"},{"en":"Floating labels","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/floating-labels"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/layout"},{"en":"Validation","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/forms/validation"},{"en":"